id: SAFE20-2
package: fandhe-workshop-core
test: load_order
target: crates/core/src/load_gate.rs
find:     check_size(entry, bytes.len() as u64)?;
replace:     check_json_depth(bytes)?; check_size(entry, bytes.len() as u64)?;
expect-fail: size_is_decided_before_depth
expect-fail: rejecting_stage_is_the_first_violated_in_contract_order
note: 深さの段を大きさの段より先にする（判定の順序の入れ替え）
